ἐκάθισεν",707006,2],["μετὰ",708780,0],["τῆς",709436,16],["πενθερᾶς",710249,17],["αὐτῆς",702165,86]],"And Ruth joined herself to the damsels of Booz to glean until they had finished the barley-harvest and the wheat-harvest."]]